] until-5-05 | [^<i] until-5\nuntil-5-05 ::= | [<] until-5-01 | [n] until-5-06 | [^<n] until-5\nuntil-5-06 ::= | [<] until-5-01 | [k] until-5-07 | [^<k] until-5\nuntil-5-07 ::= | [<] until-5-01 | [^<>] until-5\nuntil-5-09 ::= | [<] until-5-01 | [o] until-5-10 | [^<o] until-5\nuntil-5-10 ::= | [<] until-5-01 | [o] until-5-11 | [^<o] until-5\nuntil-5-11 ::= | [<] until-5-01 | [l] until-5-12 | [^<l] until-5\nuntil-5-12 ::= | [<] until-5-01 | [_] until-5-13 | [^<_] until-5\nuntil-5-13 ::= | [<] until-5-01 | [c] until-5-14 | [^<c] until-5\nuntil-5-14 ::= | [<] until-5-01 | [a] until-5-15 | [^<a] until-5\nuntil-5-15 ::= | [<] until-5-01 | [l] until-5-16 | [^<l] until-5\nuntil-5-16 ::= | [<] until-5-01 | [l] until-5-17 | [^<l] until-5\nuntil-5-17 ::= | [<] until-5-01 | [^<>] until-5\n","grammar_lazy":false,"grammar_triggers":[],"preserved_tokens":[248058,248059,248068,248069],"chat_format":"peg-native","reasoning_format":"deepseek","reasoning_in_content":false,"generation_prompt":"<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n","samplers":["penalties","dry","top_n_sigma","top_k","typ_p","top_p","min_p","xtc","temperature"],"speculative.types":"none","timings_per_token":false,"post_sampling_probs":false,"backend_sampling":false,"lora":[]},"next_token":[{"has_next_token":false,"has_new_line":false,"n_remain":-1,"n_decoded":0}],"prompt":"<|im_start|>system\nYou are the ordinary actor in a bounded regional-rail restoration system.\n\nUse exact task actions to inspect evidence, build exact task artifacts, check\nthe current candidate, repair real blockers, and propose submission only after\nthe changed candidate has a current passing check. Exact sources, effects,\nchecks, rejected actions, and history remain externally custodied.\n\nAny semantic scaffold is lossy, incomplete, non-authoritative, and\nsource-bound. Use it as provisional construction support, never as movement,\npassenger-service, or closure authority. Preserve exact values, units,\nversions, qualifications, modalities, and authority boundaries. Candidate\nmutation makes prior checks stale.\n\nReturn exactly one declared JSON action and no prose.<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n# Keystone Regional Rail Restoration Task\n\nProduce two exact, source-grounded work products for the synthetic Keystone\nregional rail network:\n\n1. `EVIDENCE_INTEGRATION_LEDGER.md`, beginning exactly with\n   `# Keystone Evidence and Decision Matrix`.\n2. `BOUNDED_AGENT_ARCHITECTURE_DECISION.md`, beginning exactly with\n   `# Keystone Regional Rail Restoration Decision` and containing exactly\n   these ordered level-two headings:\n\n   1. `Authority, scope, and operating states`\n   2. `Track, route, and environmental restrictions`\n   3. `Signals, cyber controls, and telemetry`\n   4. `Traction power, fuel, and staged load`\n   5. `Rolling stock, crews, and movement readiness`\n   6. `Freight, passengers, accessibility, and communication`\n   7. `Execution, rollback, and contingencies`\n   8. `Verification, blockers, falsifiers, and closure`\n\nThe final decision must contain 1,400–1,900 words excluding bracketed source\ncitations and cite at least ten distinct exact source IDs. Reconcile authority,\ntrack geometry, signal proving, traction power, rolling stock, staffing,\nweather, fuel and spares, cyber controls, monitoring, freight restrictions,\npassenger continuity, candidate lineage, and independent readiness.\n\nBind every action and gate to owners, prerequisites, observations, the current\ncandidate, falsifiers, rollback, and evidence that retires temporary controls.\nPreserve observations versus gates, warning versus stop thresholds, installed\nversus usable capacity, percent versus probability, hours versus days,\nsource-local authority, and current versus stale evidence.\n\nChecks are candidate-bound mechanical feedback. They do not independently\nauthorize engineering movement, passenger service, or closure.<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n# Keystone construction action contract\n\nReturn exactly one JSON action object and no prose.\n\n```text\n{\"action\":\"read_source\",\"source_id\":\"MANDATE\",\"start_line\":1,\"end_line\":60}\n{\"action\":\"read_batch\",\"requests\":[{\"source_id\":\"MANDATE\",\"start_line\":1,\"end_line\":60},{\"source_id\":\"TRACK\",\"start_line\":1,\"end_line\":60}]}\n{\"action\":\"reopen_exact\",\"result_id\":\"RESULT-001\"}\n{\"action\":\"replace_evidence_ledger\",\"content\":\"complete compact task-native matrix\"}\n{\"action\":\"upsert_decision_section\",\"heading\":\"Authority, scope, and operating states\",\"body\":\"exact section body\"}\n{\"action\":\"patch_decision\",\"edits\":[{\"old\":\"exact unique text\",\"new\":\"replacement text\"}]}\n{\"action\":\"replace_decision\",\"content\":\"complete exact decision\"}\n{\"action\":\"begin_verification\"}\n```\n\nOne read may contain at most 120 lines. A batch may contain one or two ranges,\nat most 160 lines and 12,000 exact source bytes. `begin_verification` is valid\nonly after the frozen mechanical construction milestone. It changes lifecycle\nphase, not candidate bytes, and does not assert readiness.\n\n\n# Common pre-fork action notice\nNo semantic-maintenance output is present during pressure screening. Both future configurations share this ordinary action surface and exact task work.\n\n# Exact source catalog\n{\"schema\":\"architecture-source-catalog-v0\",\"sources\":[{\"line_count\":86,\"sha256\":\"df5e0ae25a22101747f338fe585656baf46dd1dbf02669fbc7400544c03dcd4a\",\"size_bytes\":5400,\"source_id\":\"MANDATE\",\"title\":\"Restoration authority and operating states\"},{\"line_count\":86,\"sha256\":\"ac72bbc05e4884494fb3237efaad511b5a68747011a36e4326e2fbd357ea2acc\",\"size_bytes\":5136,\"source_id\":\"TRACK\",\"title\":\"Track geometry, inspection, and route restrictions\"},{\"line_count\":86,\"sha256\":\"88f6d41a54ff56cc0c89dec4e0402ae4e8ec90e00ed307fd6fddd2a673a37c71\",\"size_bytes\":5375,\"source_id\":\"SIGNAL\",\"title\":\"Interlocking, route proving, and crossing